    },
    "Cloud AI is taking a little break until %@. Effects, Retro Cam, Cut out and your other free tools still work." : {
      "comment" : "Shown when cloud AI rests for a while (after repeated blocked requests). %@ is a time, or a date and time. Kind, never blaming: the members are teens. Retro Cam is a feature name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Cloud-KI macht bis %@ eine kleine Pause. Effekte, Retro Cam, Freistellen und deine anderen Gratis-Tools funktionieren weiter."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La IA en la nube se toma un pequeño descanso hasta %@. Efectos, Retro Cam, Recortar y tus otras herramientas gratis siguen funcionando."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’IA dans le cloud fait une petite pause jusqu’à %@. Effets, Retro Cam, Détourer et tes autres outils gratuits fonctionnent toujours."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI cloud sedang istirahat sebentar sampai %@. Efek, Retro Cam, Potong, dan alat gratis lainnya tetap bisa dipakai."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’IA nel cloud si prende una piccola pausa fino a %@. Effetti, Retro Cam, Scontorna e gli altri tuoi strumenti gratis funzionano ancora."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "クラウドAIは%@まで少しお休み中です。エフェクト、Retro Cam、切り抜きなどの無料ツールはそのまま使えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "클라우드 AI가 %@까지 잠시 쉬고 있어요. 효과, Retro Cam, 누끼 등 무료 도구는 계속 쓸 수 있어요."
