    },
    "Cloud AI is turned off here for now. Effects, Retro Cam, Cut out and your other free tools still work. If you think this is a mistake, write to us at %@." : {
      "comment" : "Shown when cloud AI is off for this install until the team lifts it. %@ is the support email address. Kind, never blaming: the members are teens.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Cloud-KI ist hier vorerst ausgeschaltet. Effekte, Retro Cam, Freistellen und deine anderen Gratis-Tools funktionieren weiter. Wenn du denkst, dass das ein Fehler ist, schreib uns an %@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La IA en la nube está desactivada aquí por ahora. Efectos, Retro Cam, Recortar y tus otras herramientas gratis siguen funcionando. Si crees que es un error, escríbenos a %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
