    "Glowlit keeps you, you. Try hair color, makeup colors, outfits, light or backgrounds." : {
      "comment" : "Shown when a request is blocked by the content policy",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bei Glowlit bleibst du du. Probier Haarfarbe, Make-up-Farben, Outfits, Licht oder Hintergründe."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glowlit te deja ser tú. Prueba con el color de pelo, colores de maquillaje, outfits, la luz o el fondo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avec Glowlit, tu restes toi. Essaie une couleur de cheveux, des couleurs de maquillage, des tenues, la lumière ou le fond."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glowlit menjaga kamu tetap jadi dirimu. Coba warna rambut, warna makeup, outfit, cahaya, atau latar."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glowlit ti lascia come sei. Prova colore dei capelli, colori del trucco, outfit, luce o sfondi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glowlitはあなたをあなたのままに。髪色、メイクの色、服、光、背景を変えてみてね。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glowlit은 나를 나답게 지켜요. 머리 색, 메이크업 색, 옷, 조명, 배경을 바꿔 보세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O Glowlit mantém você do seu jeito. Experimente cor de cabelo, cores de maquiagem, looks, luz ou fundos."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glowlit сохраняет тебя собой. Попробуй цвет волос, оттенки макияжа, наряды, свет или фон."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glowlit seni sen olarak tutar. Saç rengi, makyaj renkleri, kıyafetler, ışık ya da arka planlar dene."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glowlit 让你始终是你。试试换发色、妆容颜色、服装、光线或背景吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glowlit listens to your video again and replaces these captions, including your changes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glowlit hört sich dein Video noch mal an und ersetzt diese Untertitel – auch deine Änderungen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
